      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your observation correctly identifies a valid critique within the art world regarding performance over substance. Many institutions acknowledge that depending solely on ideological compliance can indeed reduce the standard of technical merit and artistic rigor. Consequently, serious discourse has shifted away from a \"correctness\" test toward evaluating how effectively an artist synthesizes controversial ideas with distinct creative voices rather than relying on them as a substitute for skill.",
      "source": "target",
